# Real Sky provider: scoped role/name matching, native wrapping-label field,
# held below-fold Calculate click and following-step observation of its result.
settle 30
key escape
act Open Sky reference
settle 30
act Maximize pane
settle 10
assert snap panes ~ turnstone.sky
assert text Applied: 2024-04-08 in America/New_York at Boston reference observer
capture 01_sky_before_scoped_click
click surface:contributed role:button Next day
assert text Applied: 2024-04-09 in America/New_York at Boston reference observer
assert text Receipt 74883b5db9fa959cccdeb69744da4a99baec5bfd55bade77426cfe6b0d9c450f
click surface:contributed role:textbox Observer label
key end
insert -scoped
capture 02_sky_observer_draft
click surface:contributed role:button Calculate
assert text Applied: 2024-04-09 in America/New_York at Boston reference observer-scoped
assert text Calculated receipt
capture 03_sky_calculated
log Scoped contributed selectors applied the real Sky draft after retained scrolling
